{
  "_comment": [
    "The privileges pkid and pki-httpd need, for them and nothing else.",
    "",
    "Both keep SeChangeNotifyPrivilege, without which a process can't",
    "traverse a directory to reach its executable, state or sockets. pkid",
    "also has SeAuditPrivilege, so that it can write its events",
    "(pkid.evman): the record of every certificate it issues, every",
    "decision on a held request and every revocation. It lets the holder",
    "write KMES events under its own kernel-stamped identity, nothing more.",
    "pki-httpd writes no events.",
    "",
    "authd unions the privileges of every SID on a token, and a service",
    "token carries the S-1-5-80 service SID derived from the service name,",
    "so a record named for that SID grants the privileges to that one",
    "service.",
    "",
    "The SIDs below are SHA-1 of 'PKID' and 'PKI-HTTPD' as upper-cased",
    "UTF-16LE, read as five little-endian u32s, which is the derivation",
    "authd and peinit both implement (authd/src/service_sid.rs), and they",
    "are pkid_core's SERVICE_SID and HTTPD_SERVICE_SID, which pki's tests",
    "check them against. A .reg file can't compute them; if a service is",
    "ever renamed, its SID here must be recomputed.",
    "",
    "Separate from pki-services.reg because a privilege grant is a",
    "different kind of statement from a service definition: an image may",
    "review or withhold it, and an administrator looking for what on this",
    "machine may write audit events should find one file that answers it.",
    "",
    "Shipped by the pki package into /usr/share/regim/; inert until an",
    "image names it in [registry] autoapply."
  ],
  "keys": [
    { "path": "Machine\\Generic" },
    { "path": "Machine\\Generic\\Authn" },
    { "path": "Machine\\Generic\\Authn\\Policy" },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\Generic\\Authn\\Policy\\S-1-5-80-927106304-3681130234-3843647545-210868499-909250352",
      "values": [
        {
          "name": "Privileges",
          "type": "multi",
          "data": ["SeChangeNotifyPrivilege", "SeAuditPrivilege"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\Generic\\Authn\\Policy\\S-1-5-80-4101192810-2505649581-2921298127-1686389970-3617382032",
      "values": [
        { "name": "Privileges", "type": "multi", "data": ["SeChangeNotifyPrivilege"] }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
